From c147aa64b37ac686792822445ef5e1ef4c7e97ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shunnag <5158650+shunnag@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:00:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ui: support WPA3-Personal (SAE) networks when the driver
 supports SAE

Probe wpa_supplicant auth capabilities before exposing SAE-only networks.
Create SAE profiles without auth-alg while preserving PSK and hidden-network behavior.
Cover security classification, capability retries, and connection settings.
---
